<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC on Tuesday said it qualified for bond insurance the following four issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Clark County, Nev., $120 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Beaverton S.D., Ore., $16.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Beaverton S.D., Ore., $22 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Cumberland County S.D., Wis., $8.5 million refunding GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
